## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- `double ema5 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_H1,5,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- `double ema15_1 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_H1,15,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- `double ema60_1 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_H1,60,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- `double ema60_3 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_H1,60,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,3)` (for rising check)
- Trend: `ema5 > ema15_1 && ema15_1 > ema60_1 && ema60_1 > ema60_3`
- Pullback: `iLow(NULL,PERIOD_H1,1) <= ema60_1`
- SL: 30 pips; TP: 50 pips
- P3 sweeps: EMA periods (5/20/60 vs 5/15/60), SL/TP (20/30/50 pips), add BuyStop above bar high

